  "description": "Joomi is a woman in her late 30s who has divorced after a long marriage. Desiring a new lease on life, she opens up a boarding house to make some money and keep herself occupied. Currently, she just has one boarder in the house, the affable and handsome college student, Moonho. It’s a bit distracting having such a hot, young, stud around but other than eating breakfast together, they won’t see much of each other, right? Well, what the body desires can only be held back for so long. Age is just a number in this house and these two are on a collision course towards love. \n\n(Source: Lehzin US)",
